TEST T33374 -- (216) Authentication&Security - Re-authentication option
================================================================================
Run:      2026-10-23 15:20-15:38 NZDT.  802.1X re-authentication was measured on the
          wire at four settings of the period, plus its removal.
          The DUT's clock reads UTC, 13 hours behind the NZDT times in this log.
          Device time 02:18:43 UTC was read against box time 02:18:57 UTC, so the two
          clocks agree and their times can be compared directly.
Bench:    tb277, consoles u2 (swi_d); Test Engineer bidhanc@bidhanc-dl
