  => STEP 0 PASS: 6 EAPOL frames in 106 seconds.  The DUT authenticated the supplicant
     once and then sent nothing for the remaining 105 seconds.  This also proves the
     supplicant tool does not create periodic traffic of its own.  6 is the number the
     next steps must change.

