RESULT T33374-S3-REMOVED-no-auth-reauthentication: 1/1 matched -- MATCH

  => STEP 4 PASS: 6 EAPOL frames in 76 seconds.  That is the same count as the STEP 0
     control, in a window that would have carried five re-authentications if the timer
     were still armed.  The period value 15 was still configured the whole time.  So
     the enable command arms the timer; the period on its own does nothing.

